flowchart TB
accTitle: Compute once; distribute the published artifact many times
accDescr: Transaction writes remain on the primary. A daily reporting job reads a replica and publishes immutable S3 files that CloudFront serves repeatedly.
 Vote[Voting API] -->|transaction writes| P[RDS primary]
 P -->|asynchronous replication| R[Read replica]
 R -->|daily analytical query| Job[Report generation]
 Job -->|one versioned edition| S3[S3 report files]
 S3 -->|cache fill| CF[CloudFront edge caches]
 CF -->|millions of downloads| Readers[Global readers]
